Package: rqaem
Title: Recurrence Quantification Analysis of Eye Movements
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nicki", "Anderson", , "nicki@cognitive3d.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Walter F.", "Bischof", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of the reference Python and MATLAB implementations")
  )
Description: Tools for recurrence quantification analysis (RQA) of
    fixation sequences as described in Anderson, Bischof, Laidlaw, Risko
    and Kingstone (2013) <doi:10.3758/s13428-012-0299-5>. Provides a tidy
    data-frame workflow with sparse recurrence matrices, bootstrap
    significance testing, and radius selection. Ports the reference
    Python and MATLAB implementations at bit-for-bit parity on the
    bundled test fixtures.
